64You are at a complex junction.  A low hands and knees passage from the
64north joins a higher crawl from the east to make a walking passage
64going west.  There is also a large room above.  The air is damp here.
65You are in bedquilt, a long east/west passage with holes everywhere.
65To explore at random select north, south, up, or down.
66You are in a room whose walls resemble swiss cheese.  Obvious passages
66go west, east, ne, and nw.  Part of the room is occupied by a large
